{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"user-3","name":"プロデューサー","text":"────ごちそうさまでした","trans":"——多谢款待","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-4","name":"プロデューサー","text":"腹が膨れたら……ふぁ……眠気が……","trans":"吃饱了……呼啊……就犯困……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-5","name":"プロデューサー","text":"お昼休みが終わるまで少しだけ休むか\r\n……アラーム、セット……よし","trans":"午休结束前稍微休息一下吧\n……设个闹钟……好","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-9","name":"プロデューサー","text":"おやすみなさい──……","trans":"晚安——……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901016210010","name":"円香","text":"……何、この音","trans":"……什么啊，这声音","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901016210020","name":"円香","text":"…………え、寝てる……","trans":"…………诶，睡着了……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901016210040","name":"円香","text":"仕事場のデスクで熟睡とか\r\n……流石ですね、ミスター・ドリーマー","trans":"在工作单位的桌上熟睡\n……真不愧是，梦想家先生","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}